{
  "id": 22,
  "name": "lookahead_density_v1",
  "intent": "Add a bounded connectivity bonus via nearest_remaining to penalize candidates whose next-hop would be forced to a far unvisited neighbor (dead-end avoidance, especially helpful in grid corners), and modestly raise cluster_density weight so structured neighborhoods are exploited without overpowering distance. Distance remains dominant, the progressive return penalty bounds late-stage tour length, and regret discourages premature commitment when a clearly closer alternative exists.",
  "tags": [
    "lookahead",
    "cluster"
  ],
  "code": "def priority(f):\n    d = f['distance']\n    rd = f['return_distance']\n    p = f['progress']\n    nr = f['nearest_remaining']\n    cd = f['cluster_density']\n    rg = f['regret']\n    return -d + (0.18 + 0.28 * p) * rd - 0.10 * nr + 0.08 * cd + 0.22 * rg",
